OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 RAF hangars face demolition
OL,4,Afor 150 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree World War Two RAF hangars could
OL,7,Fbe demolished under controversial plans
OL,8,Fto build up to 150 homes on a former
OL,9,Fairfield site.
OL,11,FRAF Colerne in Wiltshire served as a
OL,12,Fsatellite airfield during the Battle of
OL,13,FBritain, helping Spitfire and Hurricane
OL,14,Ffighter squadrons defend Bristol.
OL,16,FColerne's residents have mixed views on
OL,17,Fthe plans - with some raising concerns
OL,18,Fover traffic, pressure on already
OL,19,Fstretched infrastructure and the loss
OL,20,Fof WW2 heritage. Others want to see new
OL,21,Fhomes built.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
